WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.730
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.430
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.140
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.140
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.470
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.470
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.460
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:39.070
I'm Tails! I always hang around with Sonic, right Sonic!

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:40.780
Sort of.

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:47.290
I'm Cream and this is my friend Cheese. Nice to meet you.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:52.710
Yeah, same here. It seems we'll become good friends.

00:01:53.170 --> 00:01:55.130
He's my grandfather.

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:56.800
Fantastic!

00:01:57.010 --> 00:02:00.970
I've never seen such micron sized radio controlled planes before.

00:02:01.510 --> 00:02:04.100
Something like this is no big deal.

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:07.480
But... You're too reckless!

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:11.480
You're dealing with the military, you know! War could've broke out.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:14.900
It'll work out somehow.

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:17.650
That's not the point.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:19.070
Oh!

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:25.580
No, well this is really fantastic. Where did you learn all this scientific technology?

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:29.210
Where? All I can say is that I learned it in the world that I came from.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:32.540
So where is that world?

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:38.170
I wonder? We were thrown into this world through a space warp.

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:45.770
Uh, Sonic. If you, I, Cream and Cheese were all affected by that accident, could it also be that...

00:02:46.720 --> 00:02:50.770
All the others are here too?

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:56.530
The others who were there at that time were Knuckles, Amy and...

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:10.290
Oh. So we were thrown into this world by Chaos Control, eh?

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:16.380
Oh well. I'll establish the foundation for the Eggman Empire in this world.

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:20.090
Then I'll expand my territory to other worlds!

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:27.240
Episode 3

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:27.240
Dr. Eggman's Ambition

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:01.340
I guess I'll start by conquering this town.

00:04:01.880 --> 00:04:03.510
Which one will you choose?

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:05.550
Let me see…

00:04:06.050 --> 00:04:10.520
Hmm. Which card should I choose?

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:16.770
Here goes.

00:04:19.820 --> 00:04:22.650
Bingo! This will be it!

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:45.550
It's all Sonic's fault.

00:04:46.010 --> 00:04:50.390
You've got it wrong, Knuckles. It all boils down to Eggman.

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:55.270
Nah. If Sonic didn't get reckless, this wouldn't have happened in the first place!

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:58.310
What makes you so sure?

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:03.360
Because it's always the same! Am I wrong?

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:07.620
I don't like you when you talk stink about Sonic!

00:05:07.780 --> 00:05:09.200
Well that's just fine!

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:12.160
Hey, are you going to leave me behind?

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.870
If you don't like me, don't follow me.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:18.290
Really, you're just so stubborn.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:21.960
Hey wait for me, Knuckles!

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:25.760
There.

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:44.030
There!

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:45.610
Here goes!

00:05:49.410 --> 00:05:51.490
Come on. Don't hit so hard.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:38.500
Go for it, E-23!

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:43.040
Teach them how powerful Dr. Eggman is!

00:06:49.930 --> 00:06:51.470
Spick and span.

00:06:51.800 --> 00:06:54.430
If you wax it, it'll shine even more.

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:57.470
Is it good?

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.310
Chao, chao.

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:00.560
That's good.

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:01.770
Tails!

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:03.810
What is it?

00:07:03.860 --> 00:07:04.860
Where's Sonic?

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:09.820
Sonic said he was going out for a walk and left.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.780
Even after I told him that he'll be seen if he leaves the house.

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:15.080
He may be seen, but he won't get caught.

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:16.950
I guess so, but…

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:20.330
And what did you want with Sonic?

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:23.830
There's big trouble in town right now!

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:34.760
Freeze! Freeze, or we'll shoot!

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:41.850
Fire!

00:07:53.990 --> 00:07:55.490
You can't stop me.

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:08.420
We got him.

00:08:14.640 --> 00:08:21.100
You fools! Something like that won't work! Now who's your superior?!

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:23.730
The chief of police.

00:08:23.730 --> 00:08:26.690
Then call him here.

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:36.910
I wonder where Sonic went.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:42.660
Sonic!

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:45.580
Sonic!

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:49.420
Where are you? Please answer us if you're around!

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.510
Sonic!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:56.970
I guess he's not here. Let's look somewhere else.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:39.930
Why don't we rest a while?

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:42.350
You don't have to follow me, you know!

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:48.020
I can't let Knuckles go off on his own.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:51.940
Do you think we're going to be able to return home?

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:54.530
I don't 'think', I 'know'.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:55.860
How?

00:09:56.240 --> 00:10:00.570
Well how else, but to find a way. At least I will.

00:10:02.910 --> 00:10:08.420
I've got to go back. I have something I have to protect.

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:11.000
I've got work to do!

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:19.550
That's why I can't be wasting my time in a place like this!

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:27.560
What's that?

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:16.860
E-23, I'll see you at the roof!

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:20.950
Roger!

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:35.460
We're the center of attention!

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:42.680
I will move on to the roof.

00:11:59.440 --> 00:12:01.570
Okay, I guess it's about time for me to introduce myself!

00:12:03.860 --> 00:12:12.960
People, listen up! My name is Dr. Eggman! I am the genius scientist of this century!

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:17.500
I am going to establish the Eggman Empire here starting right now!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:21.760
This world will be mine!

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:26.470
Dr. Eggman.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:29.260
Is that robot yours?!

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:31.060
Absolutely!

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:36.150
Then get that robot out of the way right this minute! It's a total nuisance!

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:40.360
You give me this town then!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:43.700
Just what do you mean?

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:45.860
I mean this!

00:12:55.960 --> 00:12:58.130
Give me this town!

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:03.050
I don't have the authority to. Tell the Mayor.

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:06.510
Then get the Mayor!

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:23.530
Hurry, Chris!

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.650
I'm sorry.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.290
Take care of Chris. Okay, Tails?

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:33.000
You can count on me!

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:36.000
Tell Sonic about this when he comes home, okay?

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:37.960
Of course!

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:39.750
We'll be on our way then!

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:54.640
And what is your answer?

00:13:55.560 --> 00:14:00.560
Dr. Eggman, we will not yield to your threats!

00:14:00.770 --> 00:14:01.980
Whatever...

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:18.920
Well? Are you going to give it to me or not?!

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:27.970
You'll have to ask the governor... rather the President.

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:33.010
E-23, beat them to a pulp...

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:33.930
Cut it out, Eggman!

00:14:42.940 --> 00:14:45.780
Tails?! Is Sonic with you too?!

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:53.330
E-23! Intruders have gone your way! Beat them to a pulp!

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:54.200
Roger.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.590
Wow! I'm getting really dizzy!

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:05.880
Okay, it's our turn now!

00:15:19.480 --> 00:15:21.650
It's no good. The attacks don't work.

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:23.940
Tails, look below!

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.490
The propeller's been destroyed!

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.380
We're fine now!

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:54.550
It's Tails!

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:56.720
We've got to go help them!

00:15:57.010 --> 00:15:59.100
I really don't want to get involved with them.

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:00.980
Stupid Knuckles!

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:03.230
Hey, Amy!

00:16:06.150 --> 00:16:07.860
Talk about a nuisance.

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:14.410
Amy!

00:16:15.780 --> 00:16:17.080
Wait up!

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:23.210
Damn! What's with everybody anyway?!

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:42.980
What's he talking about?

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:51.230
Eggman! So he's here too!

00:16:57.070 --> 00:16:58.830
They seem to be having fun.

00:17:12.210 --> 00:17:14.670
So that's it. I'll wait till he's off guard.

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:18.760
What took you so long, Amy?

00:17:20.140 --> 00:17:22.850
Why you…

00:17:22.970 --> 00:17:25.810
Stop bullying Tails!

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:27.480
Don't, Amy!

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:30.190
Take that!

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:35.200
Ouch!

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:44.370
Let Amy go!

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:47.250
Hold it, Knuckles!

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.460
If you try anything...

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:54.760
No! Ouch!

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:02.470
I've got to hurry or the fun will be over.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:12.230
You dirty rat. Let go of Amy!

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:16.780
Dirty rat? She's the one who first picked the fight.

00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:19.990
All E-23 did was protect himself.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:20.950
Huh?

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:25.500
I don't see him... that horrible hedgehog.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:28.580
If only Sonic were here.

00:18:33.300 --> 00:18:35.630
It's Sonic! Sonic's come!

00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:36.670
What?!

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:40.010
Sonic!

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:54.150
Thank you.

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:59.280
Here he comes, E-23!

00:19:05.330 --> 00:19:06.490
All right.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:12.630
Fire!

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:21.380
Did you get him?!

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:30.060
Up there!

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:39.780
Come on, come on!

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:42.570
Why you… how dare you mock me!

00:19:46.330 --> 00:19:49.250
Sonic! It's about time you finish him off!

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:51.160
Okay!

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:00.630
See you.

00:20:01.300 --> 00:20:02.590
Fire!

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:12.350
We did it!!

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:18.860
Too bad!

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:30.790
All right!

00:20:43.050 --> 00:20:44.010
Now what?

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:47.600
Why how dare you, Sonic!

00:20:48.010 --> 00:20:52.730
You'll pay for this. Our battle has just begun!

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:01.320
Sonic!

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:04.240
I missed you so much!

00:21:04.740 --> 00:21:05.610
Hey.

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:09.490
I thought that I'd never see you again!

00:21:09.660 --> 00:21:11.750
Hey, you're choking me.

00:21:19.960 --> 00:21:21.550
Everyone raise your hands!

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:24.340
What're you guys?

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.680
Do as you're told!

00:21:29.930 --> 00:21:31.850
You guys sure are rude.

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:35.560
You wanna fight?

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:40.020
Sonic! Grab this!

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:43.440
Come on, Knuckles!

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:47.410
Hurry, Knuckles!

00:21:50.330 --> 00:21:51.580
Fire!

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:07.680
Let's go to my house for now.

00:22:08.260 --> 00:22:10.850
Cream and Cheese are waiting for us there too.

00:22:11.180 --> 00:22:14.350
Huh, really?! So we're all together again?

00:22:14.930 --> 00:22:17.270
Sorry. Count me out.

00:22:20.060 --> 00:22:21.440
Knuckles!

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:23.530
So long!

00:22:29.030 --> 00:22:31.530
Knuckles... why?

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:35.910
He's got his thing to do.

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:48.760
<b>Tabidatsu junbi wa dekita kai?</b>

00:22:44.920 --> 00:22:48.760
<i>Are you ready to go on a journey?</i>

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:52.010
<b>mata hitotsu asa ga kuru</b>

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:52.010
<i>Another morning has arrived</i>

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:55.580
<b>Atarashii shatsu ni kigaete</b>

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:55.580
<i>Change into a new shirt</i>

00:22:55.580 --> 00:22:59.020
<b>Kurayami wo nukedasou</b>

00:22:55.580 --> 00:22:59.020
<i>And escape the darkness</i>

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:02.480
<b>Nemuranai machi wa kyou mo</b>

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:06.610
<i>The sleepless city quietly watches over you again today</i>

00:23:02.480 --> 00:23:06.610
<b>Shizuka ni tada mimamotteiru</b>

00:23:09.430 --> 00:23:12.660
<b>Kimi to boku ga hajimatteyuku!</b>

00:23:09.430 --> 00:23:12.660
<i>We begin to go!</i>

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:16.240
<b>To be shine, To be free</b>

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:18.960
<b>Tomadowanai de</b>

00:23:16.240 --> 00:23:18.960
<i>Don't be bewildered</i>

00:23:19.690 --> 00:23:25.940
<b>Toki no nami wa tsuyoku yasashii</b>

00:23:19.690 --> 00:23:25.940
<i>The waves of time are strong and kind</i>

00:23:26.820 --> 00:23:30.930
<b>Sugu ni sugu ni kimi wo mukae ni yuku</b>

00:23:26.820 --> 00:23:30.930
<i>I will come quickly to meet you</i>

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:37.060
<b>Kimi to boku no sekai wo terasou</b>

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:37.060
<i>Shine a light on our world</i>

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:40.620
<b>To be shine, To be free</b>

00:23:40.620 --> 00:23:44.130
<b>Kowagaranai de</b>

00:23:40.620 --> 00:23:44.130
<i>Don't be scared</i>

00:23:44.130 --> 00:23:50.300
<b>Toki no nami wa tsuyoku yasashii</b>

00:23:44.130 --> 00:23:50.300
<i>The waves of time are strong and kind</i>

00:23:51.220 --> 00:23:54.660
<b>Haruka tooi michi no mukou gawa e</b>

00:23:51.220 --> 00:23:54.660
<i>At the other end of the very long road</i>

00:23:54.660 --> 00:23:58.180
<b>Sugu ni sugu ni kimi wo mukae ni yuku</b>

00:23:54.660 --> 00:23:58.180
<i>I will come quickly to meet you</i>

00:23:58.180 --> 00:24:02.250
<b>Kimi to boku no mirai mitsukeyou ze</b>

00:23:58.180 --> 00:24:02.250
<i>Let's find our future</i>

00:24:30.880 --> 00:25:35.360
Get The Chaos Emerald!
